[I] A fast compressor/decompressor

[T] Snappy is a compression/decompression library. It does not aim for
[T] maximum compression, or compatibility with any other compression library;
[T] instead, it aims for very high speeds and reasonable compression.

[U] https://github.com/google/snappy

[A] Google <opensource@google.com>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
[F] OBJDIR

[L] OpenSource
[V] 1.3.1
[P] X -----5---9 120.000

[D] dd4fe215b7a11b3632d3081f68b961d0372c6bc6c0bc252597e8067f snappy-1.3.1.tar.gz https://github.com/google/snappy/archive/refs/tags/1.3.1/

[ "$SDECFG_STATIC" = 1 ] || var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON
var_append cmakeopt ' ' '-DSNAPPY_BUILD_BENCHMARKS=OFF -DSNAPPY_BUILD_TESTS=OFF'
